# T1 (from tp4-tpub-jobs S1, retargeted to this image): the AUDITED smoke of the traced carry copies on c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-tpub (every verify audit, the fused-commit audit and the
# singles audit on, QWEN_FAST_TP4_TRACED_PUBLISH=1 and QWEN_FAST_TP4_TRACED_PUBLISH_AUDIT=1). THE ARM DEPENDS ON IT: a failure here means T2, T3 and TT1 to TT4 (every tpub job) must be
# skipped by the driver (see the NEEDS lines of ORDER.txt); the window itself continues (soft for the window, a dependency for the tpub arm only).
# READ: one '[TPUB] carry traces engaged' line per request engine and NO '[TPUB] carry traces declined' line; '[TPUB-AUDIT] op=save checked=960 mismatches=0' (960 = 48 layers x 5 tensors
# x 4 chips) and at least one '[TPUB-AUDIT] op=restore' line, every one with mismatches=0; the packed lines unchanged from the recipe; c2_smoke_check clean; concurrent4_solo and concurrent4
# in this job (the smoke checks the four users against solo in-job); concurrent4_code_equal content and reasoning hashes equal to S0's and BS's on this window (every recipe here is exact).
# STOP the tpub arm on any mismatch or decline. Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min, engine build 10-30 min, the smoke 30-60 min: 100 min at most.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/next-5 four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-5 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/next-5 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-tpub
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4_solo,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,concurrent4_code_equal
